# Leibniz Agent - FSM Dialogues
# Environment file for appointment booking FSM dialogues

# Appointments Category
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_APPOINTMENTS_CONFIRM=Great! Your appointment is all set. You'll receive a confirmation email soon.
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_APPOINTMENTS_CANCEL=The appointment booking was cancelled. Would you like to start a new booking?
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_APPOINTMENTS_DATE_PROMPT=When would you like to schedule this appointment? You can say something like 'next Tuesday at 2pm' or 'tomorrow morning'.
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_APPOINTMENTS_TIME_PROMPT=What time would work best for you?
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_APPOINTMENTS_EMAIL_PROMPT=What's your email address? I'll send the appointment confirmation there.